          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Valid Delivery Associate Flag:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>This flag works on the previous month of the last month where a rider placed an order.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> Example: if a rider&apos;s last order date is in August, then the flag checks if the rider is a valid delivery associate in the whole month of July.</run>
