                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>Valid DA Flag:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>The filter works on the previous month from the selected churn month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>As of September 2025, there is only for UAE &amp; Qatar a Valid Delivery Associate Flag based on Keeta&apos;s recruitment requirements. </run>
